2026-10-18: The diagnostic boot gate intentionally retains an independent
interpreter BIOS leg; ordinary LLE boot uses the compiled native firmware.
The old DMG-only escape warning now excludes CGB firmware, which legitimately
executes its second mapped region at 0x200..0x8ff before FF50 unmapping.
Validation: native DMG/CGB handoff fixtures and MMX2 boot gate CPU comparison.
